OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1785352729
OL,3,CTributes as broadcaster Gerry Kelly
OL,4,Cdies aged 77
OL,6,FUTV have led tributes to former
OL,7,Fbroadcaster Gerry Kelly who has died
OL,8,Faged 77.
OL,10,FHe was best known for his hugely
OL,11,Fpopular talk show - called Kelly -
OL,12,Fwhich ran on UTV for 17 years. He died
OL,13,Fat his Ardlgass home on Sunday
OL,14,Fmorning, surrounded by his family.
OL,16,FThe former UTV and BBC Radio Ulster
OL,17,Fpresenter conducted many high-profile
OL,18,Finterviews, including with an eight-
OL,19,Fyear-old Rory McIlroy as the young
OL,20,Fgolfer chipped balls into a washing
OL,21,Fmachine.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
