OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1785352729
OL,3,CTributes as broadcaster Gerry Kelly
OL,4,Cdies aged 77
OL,6,FIn 2018, Kelly revealed he had been
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with cancer two years
OL,8,Fearlier.
OL,10,FUTV Head of News and Programmes Simon
OL,11,FClemison said: "Gerry Kelly was one of
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland's best known and much-
OL,13,Floved broadcasters.
OL,15,F"His UTV chat show Kelly ran for 17
OL,16,Fyears and became a 'must-watch' on
OL,17,FFriday nights, featuring some of the
OL,18,Fbiggest names in entertainment.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
