PN,41903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1785352729
OL,3,CTributes as broadcaster Gerry Kelly
OL,4,Cdies aged 77
OL,6,F"Gerry Kelly was back on UTV just a
OL,7,Fcouple of years ago fronting The Kelly
OL,8,FYears, a series reflecting on the
OL,9,Fhundreds of stars from the world of
OL,10,Ffilm, television, music and sport who
OL,11,Fhad come through our studio doors. We
OL,12,Fsend our sincere condolences to
OL,13,FGerry's wife, family and friends."
OL,15,FDeputy First Minister Emma Little-
OL,16,FPengelly said: "So sorry to hear of
OL,17,Fthe death of Gerry Kelly, a face and a
OL,18,Fvoice that so many generations across
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland were familiar with."
OL,26,@xD@POU
