OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1785352729
OL,3,CTributes as broadcaster Gerry Kelly
OL,4,Cdies aged 77
OL,6,FShe said he was "a much loved
OL,7,Fpresenter with a huge character".
OL,9,F"He interviewed so many, many hundreds
OL,10,Fof people across decades including his
OL,11,Ffamous clip with a young Rory McIlroy
OL,12,Fand the wash machine!
OL,14,FShe added: "Thinking of all his family
OL,15,Fand friends at this time of mourning,
OL,16,Fsending my deepest condolences and may
OL,17,FGod be with them and comfort them at
OL,18,Fthis time of sad loss."
OL,26,@nD@QOUoD@`O]qD@AOUvD@LOUzD@WO]
