PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1785352729
OL,3,CTributes as broadcaster Gerry Kelly
OL,4,Cdies aged 77
OL,6,F"I'm sorry to hear that Gerry Kelly
OL,7,Fhas died," broadcaster William Crawley
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,F"He had a rare gift for drawing out a
OL,11,Fguest with deep curiosity and genuine
OL,12,Fwarmth; he made interviews feel like
OL,13,Freal conversations.
OL,15,F"He inspired, encouraged and mentored
OL,16,Fother broadcasters too. A big star who
OL,17,Fwas always a gentleman."
OL,19,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,20,FITVX
